#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Mutter"
msgstr "Instalação do Mutter"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Mutter</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Mutter</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"            -Dtests=false              \\\n"
"            -Dprofiler=false           \\\n"
"            ..                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"            -Dtests=false              \\\n"
"            -Dprofiler=false           \\\n"
"            ..                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite requires an external program called <command>xvfb-"
"run</command>.  If you wish to run the tests, you should download and "
"install it before running <command>meson</command>.  You can obtain it from "
"<ulink url=\"&sources-anduin-http;/mutter/xvfb-run\">xvfb-run</ulink>, and "
"install it with executable permissions in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/bin</filename>.  <command>xvfb-run</command> needs "
"<command>Xvfb</command> at runtime, and <command>Xvfb</command> can be "
"installed from either <xref linkend='xorg-server'/> or <xref "
"linkend='xwayland'/>.  You should also replace "
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter> in the <command>meson</command> "
"command, with <parameter>-Dtests=true -Dclutter_tests=false</parameter>.  "
"The test suite requires the mutter schema to be installed on the system, so "
"it is better to run the tests after installing the package."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste exige um aplicativo externo chamado <command>xvfb-"
"run</command>. Se desejar executar os testes, você deveria baixá-lo e "
"instalá-lo antes de executar o <command>meson</command>. Você pode obtê-lo a"
" partir de <ulink url=\"&sources-anduin-http;/mutter/xvfb-run\">xvfb-"
"run</ulink> e instalá-lo com permissões executáveis em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/bin</filename>. <command>xvfb-run</command> precisa"
" de <command>Xvfb</command> em tempo de execução, e <command>Xvfb</command> "
"pode ser instalado a partir de <xref linkend='xorg-server'/> ou <xref "
"linkend='xwayland'/>. Você também deveria substituir "
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter> no comando <command>meson</command> por"
" <parameter>-Dtests=true -Dclutter_tests=false</parameter>. A suíte de teste"
" exige que o esquema mutter esteja instalado no sistema, de forma que é "
"melhor executar os testes depois de instalar o pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can also test basic functions of <application>Mutter</application> "
"following <xref linkend='mutter-starting'/>, after installing it."
msgstr ""
"Você também pode testar funções básicas do <application>Mutter</application>"
" seguindo <xref linkend='mutter-starting'/>, depois de instalá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:191
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to run the tests, remove the reference to "
"<application>Zenity</application> which is not a part of BLFS from one test:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja executar os testes, remova a referência ao "
"<application>Zenity</application>, que não faz parte do BLFS, de um teste:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:199
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed 's/zenity --[a-z]*/gtk4-demo/' -i "
"../src/tests/x11-test.sh</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed 's/zenity --[a-z]*/gtk4-demo/' -i "
"../src/tests/x11-test.sh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid "Now run the test suite:"
msgstr "Agora execute a suíte de teste:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:205
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja test</userinput>"

#.  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/2848
#. <filename>
#. cogl-test-framebuffer-get-bits-gl3</filename> and
#.  This needs a pipewire daemon running.  As at Aug 2023
#.            the method to run a pipewire daemon is not in BLFS
#.            (but in editor notes), so claim this a known failure.
#.  As Xi noted in #18580, this test is flaky.
#.  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/3343
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests require an active X or wayland session.  One test named "
"<filename>input-capture</filename> is known to fail.  An additional test "
"named <filename>cogl-test-offscreen-texture-formats-gles2</filename> is "
"known to fail.  A few other tests may fail depending on the configuration.  "
"Don't make any mouse or keyboard input while the test suite is running or "
"some tests may fail."
msgstr ""
"Os testes exigem uma sessão ativa do X ou wayland. Um teste chamado "
"<filename>input-capture</filename> é conhecido por falhar. Um teste "
"adicional chamado <filename>cogl-test-offscreen-texture-formats-"
"gles2</filename> é conhecido por falhar. Uns poucos outros testes "
"possivelmente falhem dependendo da configuração. Não faça nenhuma entrada de"
" mouse ou teclado enquanto a suíte de teste estiver executando ou alguns "
"testes possivelmente falhem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter>: Prevents building the tests, and "
"removes a hard requirement on <command>xvfb-run</command>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter>: Impede a construção dos testes e "
"remove um requisito difícil em <command>xvfb-run</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:239
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dprofiler=false</parameter>: Allow building this package without"
" <application>Sysprof</application>.  Remove this option if you've installed"
" <application>Sysprof</application> and want to analysis the rendering "
"performance of <application>Mutter</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dprofiler=false</parameter>: Permite construir esse pacote sem "
"<application>Sysprof</application>. Remova essa opção se você não tiver "
"instalado o <application>Sysprof</application> e desejar analisar o "
"desempenho de renderização do <application>Mutter</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dtests=true -Dclutter_tests=false</option>: Building all the tests "
"but the tests for the shipped <application>Clutter</application> library.  "
"The <application>Clutter</application> tests are known to fail with "
"<parameter>--buildtype=release</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dtests=true -Dclutter_tests=false</option>: Construir todos os "
"testes, exceto os testes para a biblioteca "
"<application>Clutter</application> enviada. Os testes "
"<application>Clutter</application> são conhecidos por falharem com "
"<parameter>--buildtype=release</parameter>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:256
#, xml-text
msgid "Starting Mutter"
msgstr "Iniciando o Mutter"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mutter</application> is normally used as a component of "
"<application>gnome-shell</application>, but it can be used as a standalone "
"Wayland compositor too.  To run <application>Mutter</application> as a "
"Wayland compositor, in a virtual console, issue:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mutter</application> normalmente é usado como um componente do "
"<application>gnome-shell</application>, mas também pode ser usado como um "
"compositor autônomo Wayland. Para executar <application>Mutter</application>"
" como um compositor Wayland, em um console virtual, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:272
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>mutter --wayland -- vte-2.91</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>mutter --wayland -- vte-2.91</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <command>vte-2.91</command> with the command line for the first "
"application you want in the Wayland session. Note that once this application"
" exits, the Wayland session will be terminated."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <command>vte-2.91</command> pela linha de comando do primeiro "
"aplicativo que você deseja na sessão do Wayland. Observe que assim que esse "
"aplicativo sair, a sessão do Wayland será terminada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:281
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mutter</application> can also function as a nested compositor "
"in another Wayland session.  In a terminal emulator, issue:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mutter</application> também pode funcionar como um compositor "
"aninhado em outra sessão do Wayland. Em um emulador de terminal, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:285
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>MUTTER_DEBUG_DUMMY_MODE_SPECS=1920x1080 mutter --wayland --nested"
" -- vte-2.91</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>MUTTER_DEBUG_DUMMY_MODE_SPECS=1920x1080 mutter --wayland --nested"
" -- vte-2.91</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:288
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <replaceable>1920x1080</replaceable> with the size you want for the "
"nested Wayland session."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <replaceable>1920x1080</replaceable> pelo tamanho que você quiser "
"para a sessão aninhada do Wayland."

